        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Yaamirukka Bayamey, The Quiet Family, Kalakalappu\n- People: Kim Jee-woon, Oviya, Sundar C\n- Topics: film debuts, remakes, box office success, horror comedy\n\nFacts:\n- The Quiet Family was director Kim Jee-woon's feature film debut.\n- Yaamirukka Bayamey is based on the 1998 Korean film The Quiet Family.\n- Oviya had box office success with her role in Sundar C's film Kalakalappu in 2012.\n- Oviya had box office success with her role in the horror comedy film Yaamirukka Bayamey in 2014.\n- Oviya portrayed glamorous roles in both Kalakalappu and Yaamirukka Bayamey.",
